.TH GO-FOR-IT-TUI 1 "November 2026" "go-for-it-qt 2.0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
go-for-it-tui \- productivity to-do list with built-in Pomodoro timer (Terminal UI)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B go-for-it-tui
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBgo-for-it-tui\fR is the keyboard-driven terminal interface for Go for It Qt.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fIPATH\fR
Path to custom SQLite database file.
.TP
\fB\-\-list\fR
Print available task lists to stdout and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-load\fR \fILIST_ID\fR
Open directly into specified list ID or name.
.TP
\fB\-\-md\fR \fIPATH\fR
Open markdown viewer in terminal.
.TP
\fB\-\-logfile\fR \fIPATH\fR
Write application log to specified file.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Display help information and exit.
.SH AUTHORS
